<section class="panel cp-span-full">
    <h2>What it is</h2>
    <p><strong>SPP Classics v2.0</strong> (celguar, 462 stars) is a repack, not a realm: Vanilla 1.12, TBC 2.4.3 and WotLK 3.3.5 on CMaNGOS with ike3 playerbots, running on localhost with no internet required after setup. The alternative to live solo servers ([Warstorm](/servers/warstorm/), [SoloCraft](/servers/solocraft/)): total control, zero community, immune to shutdowns. Already linked in our [resources](/); this is the guided tour.</p>
</section>

<section class="panel cp-span-half">
    <h2>Setup</h2>
    <ul class="guide-list">
        <li>Download <strong>SPP_Classics_V2.exe</strong> from <a href="https://github.com/celguar/spp-classics-cmangos/releases" target="_blank" rel="noopener">releases</a> (7z self-extractor, SSD recommended). Do not install over an old v1 repack.</li>
        <li>Run <strong>Server_Update.bat</strong> (~300 MB), pick your expansion by number; files download per request. Never close the launcher mid-process.</li>
        <li>Copy the Mangosbot addon from SPP_Server/Addons into your client's Interface/AddOns with out-of-date addons enabled.</li>
        <li>Create an account from the menu, set realmlist to <strong>127.0.0.1</strong>, log in. First boot is slow (1,000 random bots generate).</li>
    </ul>
</section>

<section class="panel cp-span-half">
    <h2>Bot tuning that matters</h2>
    <ul class="guide-list">
        <li><strong>Bot count:</strong> 1,000 random bots default (<code>aiplayerbot.conf</code>); lower it if the server lags after 30+ minutes, then reset random bots from menu 6.</li>
        <li><strong>SyncQuestWithPlayer:</strong> set to 1 and grouped bots auto-complete shared quests with you. The single biggest QoL toggle.</li>
        <li><strong>AutoLearnTrainerSpells / AutoLearnQuestSpells:</strong> set to 1 so bots learn on level-up.</li>
        <li><strong>Rates:</strong> XP and friends live under SERVER RATES in <code>mangosd.conf</code>.</li>
    </ul>
</section>

<section class="panel cp-span-full">
    <h2>Shutdown ritual (read this)</h2>
    <p>Never close server windows with X. Run <strong>saveall</strong> in mangosd, then <strong>ser shut 1</strong> and wait for the window to close itself, then option 0 shutdown. Skip this and you eat a rollback. Restart via Server_Update (checks updates) or Server_Start (no check).</p>
    <p class="meta-info">Sources: <a href="https://github.com/celguar/spp-classics-cmangos" target="_blank" rel="noopener">celguar/spp-classics-cmangos</a> readme (v2.0); bugs go to <a href="https://github.com/celguar/mangosbot-bots/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener">mangosbot-bots issues</a>. Self-host means self-support.</p>
</section>

